Additional notes / 补充说明
---------------------------
* Runtime, build scripts, and overlay UI code in this repository are
  adaptations of the original work and are distributed under the same
  CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 license, with attribution to the original author.
  本仓库中的运行时、构建脚本与界面代码为原作的改编,依同一许可发布,
  署名归原作者 spolsh (Michal Klos)。
* The original music referenced by the Shadertoy page ("So Electric" by
  Lifelike, uploaded by rombo_rama) is NOT included in this repository.
  原作页面引用的 SoundCloud 音乐未包含在本仓库中。
* This project is for learning and research only. / 本项目仅供学习研究,
  禁止商业用途。
